          <paragraph eId="para_1"><num>1.</num><content><p>This synthetic dispute concerns a blue boundary marker. The <b>invented</b> appeal raises one question.</p></content></paragraph>
          <paragraph eId="para_2"><num>2.</num><content><p>Compare <ref href="https://caselaw.nationalarchives.gov.uk/uksc/2024/900003" uk:type="case" uk:canonical="[2024] UKSC 900003" uk:isNeutral="true" uk:origin="TNA" uk:year="2024">Invented Grove</ref> and <ref href="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/ukpga/2099/900001/section/2" uk:type="legislation" uk:canonical="Invented Markers Act 2099" uk:isNeutral="false" uk:origin="parser">section 2</ref>.</p></content></paragraph>
          <paragraph eId="para_3"><num>3.</num><content><p>The synthetic appeal is allowed. <img src="image-synthetic.png" alt="Synthetic marker diagram"/></p></content></paragraph>
